        "text": "Started working on the AWS setup prior to course start, and it was definitely a challenge at first. I managed to use Terraform to build out environment (S3 + Redshift); while there is a “free trial” period of 750 hours with Redshift, the cheapest option is definitely running EC2 instance with Docker + PostgreSQL.\n\n(I did get data loaded from S3 into Redshift via Prefect + SQLAlchemy, but I’m migrating process to Snowflake b\/c that’s what my current job uses.)",
